flowchart TB
  subgraph artifacts [workspace/artifacts]
    J[jobs/job_id]
    I[iterations/N]
    T[tasks/task_id/trace.json]
    P[improver/prompt.txt]
    R[improver/response.json]
    J --> I
    I --> T
    I --> P
    I --> R
  end

  subgraph runs [workspace/runs/run_id]
    Spec[agent_spec.json]
    JobDir[Harbor job timestamp]
    Trial[task_id__suffix]
    Trace[agent/trace.json]
    Res[result.json]
    Spec --- JobDir
    JobDir --> Trial
    Trial --> Trace
    Trial --> Res
  end

  Trace -.->|copied after evaluate| T
